        "text": "5:57 A.M. \\ Cloudy \\ Visibility: 17 km",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "text": "Desert; 4 km from the outskirts of Lungmen",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "text": "4 days after the Chernobog rescue mission",
